{"id":"P9abGg_gF1s","title":"Theme 4. Weather - How's the weather? It's sunny. | ESL Song & Story - Learning English for Kids","speaker":"English Singsing","channel":"Kids","level":"A1","duration":"06:46","views":"3.6M","emoji":"⛅","color":"linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2)","zh":"【English Singsing】主題 4. 天氣 - 天氣怎麼樣？今天是晴天。 | ESL 歌曲與故事 - 兒童英語學習（精選雙語跟讀教材）","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P9abGg_gF1s","cues":[{"start":3.36,"duration":13.52,"text":"theme 4 Weather Let's play outside.","en":"theme 4 Weather Let's play outside.","zh":"主題 4 天氣 我們去外面玩吧。"},{"start":18.26,"duration":1.74,"text":"Sorry, I can't.","en":"Sorry, I can't.","zh":"抱歉，我不能。"},{"start":20.06,"duration":1.5,"text":"It's cold and windy.","en":"It's cold and windy.","zh":"天氣很冷，風很大。"},{"start":27.4,"duration":1.54,"text":"Look! It's snowing.","en":"Look! It's snowing.","zh":"看！正在下雪。"},{"start":31.5,"duration":1.5,"text":"It's all white.","en":"It's all white.","zh":"都是白色的。"},{"start":35.06,"duration":1.56,"text":"Do you like snow?","en":"Do you like snow?","zh":"你喜歡雪嗎？"},{"start":37.4,"duration":1.44,"text":"Yes, I do.","en":"Yes, I do.","zh":"是的，我願意。"},{"start":39.66,"duration":1.14,"text":"Let's go!","en":"Let's go!","zh":"我們走吧！"},{"start":45.78,"duration":1.52,"text":"Can you make a snowman?","en":"Can you make a snowman?","zh":"你能堆雪人嗎？"},{"start":48.18,"duration":1.42,"text":"Sure, I can.","en":"Sure, I can.","zh":"當然，我可以。"},{"start":58.36,"duration":2.62,"text":"A snowman! You're good.","en":"A snowman! You're good.","zh":"一個雪人！你很厲害。"},{"start":61.66,"duration":0.84,"text":"Thank you.","en":"Thank you.","zh":"謝謝。"},{"start":66.34,"duration":1.04,"text":"What's that?","en":"What's that?","zh":"那是什麼？"},{"start":68.06,"duration":1.16,"text":"His nose.","en":"His nose.","zh":"他的鼻子。"},{"start":73.56,"duration":2.1,"text":"Wow, a nose.","en":"Wow, a nose.","zh":"哇，一個鼻子。"},{"start":93.94,"duration":3.56,"text":"How's the weather? How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather? How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":97.54,"duration":3.08,"text":"It's sunny. It's sunny.","en":"It's sunny. It's sunny.","zh":"今天是晴天。今天是晴天。"},{"start":101.14,"duration":3.6,"text":"How's the weather? How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather? How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":104.82,"duration":3.06,"text":"It's cloudy. It's cloudy.","en":"It's cloudy. It's cloudy.","zh":"今天多雲。今天多雲。"},{"start":108.4,"duration":3.54,"text":"How's the weather? How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather? How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":111.96,"duration":3.14,"text":"It's raining. It's raining.","en":"It's raining. It's raining.","zh":"下雨了。下雨了。"},{"start":115.58,"duration":3.54,"text":"How's the weather? How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather? How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":119.24,"duration":2.76,"text":"It's snowing. It's snowing.","en":"It's snowing. It's snowing.","zh":"正在下雪。正在下雪。"},{"start":137.0,"duration":1.92,"text":"How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":139.08,"duration":3.36,"text":"It's rainy. It's rainy.","en":"It's rainy. It's rainy.","zh":"常在下雨。常在下雨。"},{"start":143.06,"duration":1.76,"text":"Is this yours?","en":"Is this yours?","zh":"這是你的嗎？"},{"start":145.08,"duration":1.98,"text":"Yes, it's mine.","en":"Yes, it's mine.","zh":"是的，它是我的。"},{"start":149.06,"duration":1.86,"text":"How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":151.14,"duration":3.34,"text":"It's sunny. It's sunny.","en":"It's sunny. It's sunny.","zh":"今天是晴天。今天是晴天。"},{"start":155.08,"duration":1.88,"text":"Is this yours?","en":"Is this yours?","zh":"這是你的嗎？"},{"start":157.08,"duration":1.94,"text":"No, it's not mine.","en":"No, it's not mine.","zh":"不，這不是我的。"},{"start":160.96,"duration":1.96,"text":"How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":163.06,"duration":3.58,"text":"It's windy. It's windy.","en":"It's windy. It's windy.","zh":"今天刮風。今天刮風。"},{"start":167.0,"duration":2.08,"text":"Is this yours?","en":"Is this yours?","zh":"這是你的嗎？"},{"start":169.08,"duration":1.8,"text":"Yes, it's mine.","en":"Yes, it's mine.","zh":"是的，它是我的。"},{"start":185.88,"duration":1.52,"text":"How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":188.14,"duration":2.56,"text":"Cloudy, it's cloudy.","en":"Cloudy, it's cloudy.","zh":"陰天，陰天。"},{"start":192.6,"duration":1.42,"text":"How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":194.8,"duration":2.56,"text":"Raining, it's raining.","en":"Raining, it's raining.","zh":"下雨了，下雨了。"},{"start":199.26,"duration":1.4,"text":"How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":201.46,"duration":2.54,"text":"Snowing, it's snowing.","en":"Snowing, it's snowing.","zh":"下雪了，下雪了。"},{"start":205.96,"duration":1.42,"text":"How's the weather?","en":"How's the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":207.98,"duration":2.78,"text":"Sunny, it's sunny.","en":"Sunny, it's sunny.","zh":"陽光明媚，天氣晴朗。"},{"start":226.56,"duration":1.74,"text":"How's the weather here?","en":"How's the weather here?","zh":"這裡天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":228.58,"duration":1.98,"text":"How's the weather here?","en":"How's the weather here?","zh":"這裡天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":230.56,"duration":1.66,"text":"It's windy and snowy.","en":"It's windy and snowy.","zh":"風很大，還下雪。"},{"start":232.22,"duration":1.84,"text":"It's windy and snowy.","en":"It's windy and snowy.","zh":"風很大，還下雪。"},{"start":234.16,"duration":1.7,"text":"Put on this hat.","en":"Put on this hat.","zh":"戴上這頂帽子。"},{"start":235.94,"duration":0.9,"text":"Yes!","en":"Yes!","zh":"是的！"},{"start":237.84,"duration":1.8,"text":"Put on this gloves.","en":"Put on this gloves.","zh":"戴上這個手套。"},{"start":239.78,"duration":0.64,"text":"Yes!","en":"Yes!","zh":"是的！"},{"start":248.86,"duration":1.84,"text":"How's the weather outside?","en":"How's the weather outside?","zh":"外面天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":250.7,"duration":1.8,"text":"How's the weather outside?","en":"How's the weather outside?","zh":"外面天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":252.62,"duration":2.7,"text":"It's rainy and cold.","en":"It's rainy and cold.","zh":"下雨了，而且很冷。"},{"start":256.28,"duration":2.72,"text":"It's rainy and cold.","en":"It's rainy and cold.","zh":"下雨了，而且很冷。"},{"start":259.98,"duration":1.7,"text":"Bring this umbrella.","en":"Bring this umbrella.","zh":"帶上這把傘。"},{"start":261.76,"duration":0.88,"text":"Yes!","en":"Yes!","zh":"是的！"},{"start":263.72,"duration":1.64,"text":"Bring this umbrella.","en":"Bring this umbrella.","zh":"帶上這把傘。"},{"start":265.46,"duration":0.6,"text":"Yes!","en":"Yes!","zh":"是的！"},{"start":285.72,"duration":1.88,"text":"How’s the weather?","en":"How’s the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":290.34,"duration":2.02,"text":"It’s raining.","en":"It’s raining.","zh":"下雨了。"},{"start":293.62,"duration":1.86,"text":"Oh, no.","en":"Oh, no.","zh":"哦，不。"},{"start":300.84,"duration":1.74,"text":"How’s the weather?","en":"How’s the weather?","zh":"天氣怎麼樣？"},{"start":303.56,"duration":1.14,"text":"It’s sunny.","en":"It’s sunny.","zh":"今天是晴天。"},{"start":306.34,"duration":1.84,"text":"Oh, no.","en":"Oh, no.","zh":"哦，不。"},{"start":313.34,"duration":1.66,"text":"Look, it’s raining.","en":"Look, it’s raining.","zh":"你看，下雨了。"},{"start":316.72,"duration":2.76,"text":"Okay, sounds good.","en":"Okay, sounds good.","zh":"好吧，聽起來不錯。"},{"start":324.5,"duration":1.22,"text":"It’s sunny now.","en":"It’s sunny now.","zh":"現在天氣晴朗。"},{"start":328.16,"duration":1.68,"text":"That’s good.","en":"That’s good.","zh":"那挺好的。"},{"start":341.92,"duration":2.82,"text":"Grumpy, Happy, Dopey.","en":"Grumpy, Happy, Dopey.","zh":"脾氣暴躁，快樂，糊塗。"},{"start":345.58,"duration":1.12,"text":"Coming.","en":"Coming.","zh":"未來。"},{"start":347.26,"duration":1.68,"text":"Let's play outside!","en":"Let's play outside!","zh":"我們去外面玩吧！"},{"start":349.54,"duration":2.2,"text":"Sorry, we can't.","en":"Sorry, we can't.","zh":"抱歉，我們不能。"},{"start":354.78,"duration":1.96,"text":"It's raining.","en":"It's raining.","zh":"下雨了。"},{"start":357.26,"duration":3.02,"text":"It's not raining. It's snowing.","en":"It's not raining. It's snowing.","zh":"沒有下雨。正在下雪。"},{"start":360.98,"duration":1.06,"text":"Snow?","en":"Snow?","zh":"雪？"},{"start":363.24,"duration":1.78,"text":"Look! It's snowing.","en":"Look! It's snowing.","zh":"看！正在下雪。"},{"start":365.34,"duration":1.34,"text":"It's all white.","en":"It's all white.","zh":"都是白色的。"},{"start":372.08,"duration":1.24,"text":"A nice hat!","en":"A nice hat!","zh":"一頂漂亮的帽子！"},{"start":376.78,"duration":1.0,"text":"What's that?","en":"What's that?","zh":"那是什麼？"},{"start":378.14,"duration":1.2,"text":"It's an apple.","en":"It's an apple.","zh":"這是一個蘋果。"},{"start":379.74,"duration":1.18,"text":"Oh, no!","en":"Oh, no!","zh":"哦，不！"},{"start":381.0,"duration":1.78,"text":"No apples!","en":"No apples!","zh":"沒有蘋果！"},{"start":385.6,"duration":1.62,"text":"Can you help me?","en":"Can you help me?","zh":"你能幫助我嗎？"},{"start":387.32,"duration":2.74,"text":"Sure. Please.","en":"Sure. Please.","zh":"當然。請。"},{"start":390.48,"duration":1.68,"text":"You can eat this apple.","en":"You can eat this apple.","zh":"你可以吃這個蘋果。"},{"start":393.64,"duration":1.02,"text":"Oh~","en":"Oh~","zh":"哦~"}],"words":[]}